    "campaign": "EASTER",
    "caption": "Curious to try new recipes with eggs? Make these Eggs all’Amatriciana using Bounty Fresh Organic Selenium Enriched Specialty Eggs!\n\nAlso known as Uova all’Amatriciana, this Italian egg dish harps on the pasta sauce made with guanciale, tomato, and Pecorino Romano cheese.\n\nIn this recipe, we’ve swapped the fancy ingredients for more accessible ones such as bacon and Parmesan cheese. They’re easy to find at #TheMarketplace, so add the ingredients below to your cart the next time you shop, and prepare to greet the day with the heartiest “Buongiorno”!\n\nServing Time: 35 minutes\nYield: 3 servings\n\nIngredients\n\n2 cups crusty bread, sliced into chunks\n4 tbsps. olive oil\nSalt and pepper to taste\n2 cups bacon, chopped\n1 white onion, diced\n5 cloves garlic, minced\n½ tsp. chili flakes\n4 cups cherry tomatoes\n½ cup parmesan cheese, grated\n3 pcs Bounty Fresh Organic Selenium Enriched Specialty Eggs\n2 tbsps. thyme sprigs\n\nProcedure\n\n1. Preheat oven to 175°C.\n2. Coat bread chunks with 2 tbsps. olive oil, then season with salt and pepper. Toast for 5-6 minutes, or until golden brown.\n3. Set a cast iron pan over medium heat. Add in bacon and cook until crisp and fat has rendered. \n4. In the same pan, add in remaining olive oil. Sauté onions, garlic and chili flakes until soft and fragrant.\n5. Add in cherry tomatoes. Smash to release its juices. Let simmer for 8-10 minutes, or until thickened.\n6. Lower down the heat, then mix in parmesan cheese. Nestle croutons to lightly submerge in the sauce. \n7. Create three holes, and carefully crack Bounty Fresh Organic Selenium Enriched Specialty Eggs into the spaces. \n8. Cover the pan, and cook the eggs for 5-8 minutes, or until the egg whites have set. Garnish with thyme sprigs. \n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
